    "caption": "At the AI Advantage Summit with Dean and Tony, it was fantastic to hear key influencers like Sabrina Romanov talk about what I call your TRUE NORTH. \n\nSabrina talks about the meaning of AUTHENTICITY: being aligned with your why, your purpose and spending time doing something that really matters to you. \n\nIt all starts with who you are - your IDENTITY - as an individual, a team, an organisation and a business. Your identity shapes how you lead, how you show up and what impact you have.\n\nWhen you understand your values and beliefs and align them to how you lead, you unlock your unique version of extraordinary. \n\nDeeply personal, highly sustainable and uniquely yours. \n\nI found my True North when I left corporate to set up my own coaching business because MEANING, LEGACY and FAMILY are my core values. They guided this decision and all the ones after that. \n\nMy True North is where my life and leadership meet and where my heart and head align. Decisions and actions are clearer and easier. And I’ve never looked back. I ❤️ who I’ve become. \n\nTrue North is not just a theory of mine. It’s a philosophy I hold dear. And now it’s a movement…\n\n👉Drop ‘YES’ if you’re with me…",
